    "introduction": {
        "text": "Every person has a natural growth cycle, just like hair. Natural lashes shed anywhere from 60-90 days, replacing themselves with new ones.\nFixing grown-out eyelash extensions is necessary every 2-3 weeks to keep your eyelashes looking full.\nThis repair guide is necessary for eyelash technicians to ensure a safe and proper eyelash extension fill procedure. Eyelash extension fills are a great opportunity to refine the client’s look based on what look they are going for. It is also a great opportunity for the lash technician to express their creativity.",
        "step_url": "https://www.ifixit.com/Guide/Eyelash+Extensions+Replacement/<#s272296>"
    },
