            "title": "",
            "step_url": "https://www.ifixit.com/Guide/Eyelash+Extensions+Replacement/<#s272301>",
            "instructions": [
                "Remove all the grown-out lashes using the banana peel method.",
                "Hold the natural lash in one clean tweezer and the eyelash extension in the other set of clean [tweezers](https://www.ifixit.com/Guide/Eyelash+Extensions+Replacement/<https://www.ifixit.com/products/tweezers>).",
                "Gently pull the natural lash and the lash extension in opposite directions and peel the lashes apart like a banana."
            ],
